          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawlo ea Silwano, ea Dimoteo, ea ganiiseeda Desalonike mida jeeda ASEETA was Bwaabwa sea Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda ea hoyyoo leabu heeda ASEETA was Ghweanda, sea heeda Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweaksiinda aba damanda hinnooda Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa gamiiseasa eebadiischeesiina galeagasean aba badahuukeagwa, fuga eaduupcheewi, ak ea gitoobiiwsiinda gil, aba gideaba masaweegeagwa niheedu muuchi, nea bariinyeega giliwas sih aba jeedeang'wa aba hichpa nuut ea niihaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu eara aseasa ea sigwareesi aba badahuukeagwa aba jeesinga ganiisajeega ASEETA aba milikghteaydeang'wa ea masaweega oondeawi aba ghabasteang'wa sean sea sawanaduutka oamilikghti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gwadeagooda girgweageeda huumwa bea ASEETA, ak abeeda geanung' ahuwa fuga miisa gheambalmeeda ASEETA, was dea ghamneawa sisawasseegwa– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean aba huumwa ASEETA gayghawaldaawa sawanadeeda aba heedeaba fugiga sawaneegwean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gagooneegwa fuufta sea aseasa agoogeeda sisawan, damanda jea eatahaaja Ng'utamiida was Yesu jea gwaleabu humng'eeda sea malaykajeagaaschi mideawa uurjeenga beasta yeat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghawalda mureandooda masisiina mureeda giijasta miy bea Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwasawana aba ghoorjooda nyariida manda muudeanooda ak geegeandeawa madeeda Ng'utamiida ea heeda giigheambiitaanyi mideawa uurda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eaweeda jea ghwahina eakghaambiit aba jeeda fugaaschi ghaydidi, ak ghahamng'eanyi buuneesean ghayi mwas ninyiin, aba gideaba muuwunoodeanya geamwas aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji, iissa geamwaashchi ASEETA galeagasean aba badahuukeagwa, gideaba gagasa ghwanung' ASEETEANYA gahaguuweegwa guurnoadaanyi, ak ghoahiit gilinyoo aamiy gasa ea gadiyeeda masaweega aba uurdaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gwanda gharbeeda gheawunga Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu aba jeesingeagwa, nea agooga geakghaambiideagwa aba jeadaanyi aba dagheerjeanduumeeda ASEETEANYA ea Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
